" Optional snippet. Merge into your existing vimrc, do not replace it.
" Copy colors/khonsu-moonlight.vim into ~/.vim/colors/ first.
" On Windows, use your Vim user runtime directory instead (:set runtimepath?).
" Exact colors require a truecolor-compatible terminal. If colors disappear,
" use :set notermguicolors and the theme's terminal-color fallback.
if exists('+termguicolors')
  set termguicolors
endif
syntax enable
colorscheme khonsu-moonlight

" Optional navigation preferences, uncomment only what you want:
" set number relativenumber
" set cursorline
" set signcolumn=yes
